# Upload filter for CLI deployments of the cloud project (repo root is the
# deployment root, see vercel.json). Only paths no Vercel project builds from:
# Go sources, build artifacts. `tools/` stays: moon resolves every project
# source in .moon/workspace.yml and the storybook service builds with moon. Entries use gitignore syntax:
# anchor directories with a leading slash, or `docs` would also drop
# `apps/docs`.
/internal
/cmd
/api/generated
/main.go
/go.mod
/go.sum
/examples
/skills
/docs
/.github
dist
.next
.vercel
test-output
*.tsbuildinfo
/apps/docs/.source
/apps/docs/.generated
/apps/storybook/out
